{
  "_doc": "Path -> feature map for scripts/check-feature-matrix.mjs. A PR that changes a mapped path must add or edit a row of at least one of that path's features in docs/testing/FEATURES.md. A changed file under src/, scripts/, public/ or design-previews/ that matches no entry fails the check until it is mapped here. Patterns: exact path, or a prefix ending in /.",
